Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:28:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] cecd: Keep every activated title in MBoxList

Titles activating StreetPass write /CEC/MBoxList____ with only their own box (Mario &
Sonic writes an empty list). HLE CECD took that buffer as the whole list and added
the title, so the last title to activate StreetPass removed all others: System
Settings > StreetPass Management showed only Mario & Sonic, while Mii Plaza and
Animal Crossing still had their boxes.

The list is now rebuilt from the box folders in /CEC every time it is written:
listed boxes that still have a folder keep their order, other folders follow, then
the title writing the list (at most 24).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
